  "user_request_original": "Design a multi-cavity defect bandpass filter on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Stack: 4 periods of HfO2/SiO2 (Gao) pairs, one HfO2 cavity layer, 2 periods of SiO2 (Gao)/HfO2 pairs, second HfO2 cavity layer, 4 periods of SiO2 (Gao)/HfO2 pairs. Total 14 layers. Optimize all individual layer thicknesses and both cavity thicknesses to maximize transmittance in 255-280 nm while minimizing transmittance in 300-700 nm and 700-1100 nm. No metal layers. Materials: hfo2, SiO2 (Gao).",
  "normalized_request_english": "Design a dielectric bandpass filter on fused silica with air incidence using alternating HfO2 and SiO2 layers with two HfO2 cavities. Optimize all 22 layer thicknesses to maximize transmittance in 255–280 nm while minimizing transmittance in 300–700 nm and 700–1100 nm at normal incidence.",
